{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"There is also, the wardens\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:36:03.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743387382555869196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The Masons do not understand that more good comes from restoring the lost divinity of these gods.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:36:54.506000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743387596612435969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web nods. \"How Florian know symbol bad meaning? If mason magic used to defeat hunger at tree, could have been used against hunger, to help defeat temporairily. Web know that hunger cannot be staved off forever. But if cannot kill for good, better to drive off and give time to prepare, yes? What is problem with wardens? Related to barrier? Masons think bring good gods, bring bad ones too. But Web not sure too bad. Especially if hunger dead.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:48:09.526000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743390427851259914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"It is not that they did not try and take the backup option, it is that to kill it permanently was not sought out from le beginning.\n\nThe wardens themselves are not an issue, they help people and domain over zis land. But to favor them and not attempt to restore the lost divinity, will result in their power remaining for selfish reasons. There are already evil gods that make influence through followers in this realm, but the good ones have all but perished. It is a fear the wardens may be stoking so that their rule here is unchallenged.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:54:04.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743391917437354064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
